### 2. Autonomous Model Selection Engine
#### [MODIFY] [predict.py](file:///c:/workshop-maintenance-system/ml/inference/predict.py)
- Implement `analyze_best_fit_model(signal, features, cnn_model, classical_model)`:
  - Computes telemetry characteristics (kurtosis, crest factor, noise floor estimate).
  - Evaluates candidate inferences: computes prediction probabilities and Shannon entropy.
  - Autonomously selects the best-fit model (e.g. 1D Deep CNN for dynamic transient waveforms, classical feature-based model for specific low-frequency steady states, or calibrated consensus).
  - Returns detailed auto-selection metadata: `selected_model`, `model_fit_reason`, `selection_confidence`, and `fit_metrics`.
- Support `model_mode="auto"` as the standard default mode.

#### [MODIFY] [ml_server.py](file:///c:/workshop-maintenance-system/ml/api/ml_server.py)
- Update `PredictRequest` to accept `model_mode: Optional[str] = "auto"` (deprecating manual `use_classical_ml`).
- Include `auto_fit_details` in `PredictResponse` (selected model name, reason, fitness metrics).

